---
title: "PDF Export - Rows"
enterprise: true
---

By default, PDF export follows the grid's filtered and sorted row order. Use the shared export parameters to export selected rows, all rows, or explicit row positions.

## Pinned Rows

Static and manually pinned top and bottom rows are included in their displayed positions. Manually pinned rows also remain in the body by default; set `skipPinnedRowDuplicates=true` to omit those body copies. Use `skipPinnedTop` or `skipPinnedBottom` to exclude the corresponding pinned section.

## Row Groups

Row groups export their current label and use indentation to represent their displayed depth. Set `rowGroupIndentSize` to control the indentation applied for each level.

```{% frameworkTransform=true %}
api.exportDataAsPdf({
    rowGroupIndentSize: 16,
    skipPinnedBottom: false,
});
```

